# Generated, never hand-authored -- reformatting drifts it from its
# generator instead of the other way around. One schema per canonical fact
# model (ADR 0050) plus the original --json envelope schema, all written by
# the same script (scripts/generate-json-schema.mjs).
schemas/*.schema.json

# Changesets-managed; reformatting past entries creates noise unrelated to
# the actual change.
CHANGELOG.md

